docs {
  Hermes API collection (one folder per feature, D-070).

  Local run: start the stack (docker compose up) and, for authenticated requests, get a test token:
    TEST_TOKEN=$(make emulator-token ROLE=admin) make bruno
  An admin token reaches every route (the f00-5-contracts folder includes admin-only ones).
  In the Bruno app, paste the same token into the `token` secret of the `local` environment.
}
